{
  "id": "JHN.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 9",
  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Yesu yabaire nahingura, abona omuntu ayabaire ali mpume kwema okuzarwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abegesibwabe bamubaza ati, “Rabi, omuntu ogu kuzarwa aigaire amaisho, ayafakaire n'ohai? Ni wenene anga abazairebe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abahorora ati, “Tiyahumisiibwe kufakarakwe anga kwa bazairebe. Ekyo kikabaho ebikorwa bya Ruhanga kabibonekera omuli wenene ogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turagiirwe kukora emilimo y'ayantumire, orwo omushana gukyajwa. Nikija kuba kiro orwo omuntu atashobore kukora mulimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo nkyali omu nsi, inye n'inye mushana gw'ensi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayabaire nagamba atyo, achwa ahansi ebichwanta abijungisa eitaka, eitaka elyo alisiga omushaija omu maisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namugambira ati, “Ogende onabe omu kitunga kya Siloamu” (nikwo kugir'oti, “Ayantumire.”) Omushaija agenda anaba, agaruka nabona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batanibe na bona abamubonaga nashabiliza bebaza bati, “Ogu tiwe mushaija atura ashuntamire nashabiliza?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abandi bati, “N'iwe,” abandi bati, “Chei, namushusha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamubaza bati, “Amaisho gawe gahumuruguka gatai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abahorora ati, “Omushaija alikwetwa Yesu yajunga eitaka yalinsiiga omu maisho, yamara yangambira ati, ‘Ogende Siloamu onabe;’ aho ngenda naba, mbona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamubaza bati, “Ali nkahai?” Ahorora ati, “Tindikumanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayahudi bakwata ayabaire ali mpume bamutwalira Abafarisayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Yesu yajunga eitaka akakiza empume ekaba eli Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafarisayo bashuba babaza ayabaire aigaire amaisho emikilireye. Abagambira ati, “Yajunga eitaka yalinsiiga omu maisho, nanaba, mbwenu nimbona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafarisayo abamoiho bati, “Omuntu ogu talikuruga ahali Ruhanga, enshonga talikwekomya Sabato.” Kyonkai abandi bati, “Omufakare yakukora atai ebitangazo nk'ebi?” Aho Abafarisayo bahakana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo bashuba babaza ayatambirwa obwigare bati, “Iwe nomugambahoki ogwo orwo yakukiza obwigare bw'amaisho?” Ahorora ati, “Murangi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayahudi tibaikiliize okwo omushaija yabaire ali mpume n'okwo yatambirwa obwigare bw'amaisho, kuhika orwo bayesire abazaire ba wenene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakababaza bati, “Ogu ni mutabani wanyu, owo mulikugamba okwo yazairwe atalikubona?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abazairebe bahorora bati, “Nitumanya okwo ogu ali mutabani waitu, n'okwo yazairwe atalikubona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai emibonereye eya mbwenu aha titulikugimanya. Mumubaze; muntu mukuru, ayehorolere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abazairebe okugamba batyo bakaba nibatina Abayahudi, enshonga Abayahudi bakaba barahiire okwo omuntu aragamba okwo Yesu ali Kirisito baramubinga omu sinagogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo abazairebe bagambiire bati, “Muntu mukuru, mubaze wenene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo beta omushaija ayakiziibwe obuhume omurundi gwa kabili, bamugambira bati, “Osiime Ruhanga, kuba nitumanya Yesu ogu okwo ali mufakare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abahorora ati, “K'araba ali mufakare, inye tindikumanya. Nimanya ekigambo kimoi kishai, okwo nabaga mpume, kyonkai mbwenu nimbona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamubaza bati, “Yakugira atai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashubamu ati, “Nabagambiire kyonkai timulikuhulira. Nimwenda kushuba kuhulira ekigambo ekyo? Nainywe nimwenda kuba begesibwabe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamujuma bati, “Omwegesibwawe n'iwe; ichwe tuli begesibwa ba Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitumanya okwo Ruhanga yafumoire na Musa; nawe omuntu ogu mbali alikuruga titulikuhamanya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakiziibwe obwigare abahorora ati, “Aha kiki? Eki kyaba kitangazo! Mbali alikuruga timulikuhamanya, kyonkai inye yampumurura amaisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitumanya okwo Ruhanga tahulira bafakare. Kyonkai k'omuntu aba ali wa Ruhanga kwo akamara akakora eby'alikwenda, omuntu ogwo Ruhanga amuhulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwema ensi yabaho tikikahulirwaga omuntu kuhumuurura ayazairwe ali mwigazi w'amaisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'omuntu ogu atakurugire ahali Ruhanga, taliho kyoyakukozire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamuhorora bati, “Okazalirwa omu bufu wabukuliramu, mbwenu noija kwegesa ichwe?” Aho bamubinga omu sinagogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu agya amanya okwo omushaija bamubinga omu sinagogi. Kayamazire kumubona amubaza ati, “Iwe noikiliza Omwana w'Omuntu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahorora ati, “N'ohai waitu, mwikilize?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amugambira ati, “Wamuboine, mara n'iwe alikufumora naiwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwo agambira Yesu ati, “Mukama, naikiliza,” amara amufukamira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu agamba ati, “Nkaija omu nsi kugiramura, abatalikubona babone, kandi abalikubona bahume amaisho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafarisayo ababaire bamuli haihi bahulira ekigambo ekyo, bamubaza bati, “Aho naichwe tuhumire?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abagambira ati, “Kuba muli mpume mwakubaire mutaina ntambara; kyonkai mbwenu orwo mulikugamba muti, ‘Nitubona,’ aho entambara yanyu nebaikaraho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
